# FURUI blind-03: the measurement pin, anchored before opening

**Status:** a pin record, anchored to the JIDEC ledger while the drawn set is still sealed and unread. It fixes the versions measured, the scope join, the nearness measure, the counting rules, the lines and the sentences before any number exists.

